[102.436, "02;102m\u276f \u001b[38;2;0;0;0mProf\u001b[8Gle this implementation on\u001b[34Gthe supplied development workloads. Improve performance within the same rules and \u001b[39m    \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;0;0;0mremaini\u001b[11Gg budget. Pres\u001b[27Gve the interface and corr\u001b[53Gctn\u001b[57Gss requirements. Do\u001b[77Gnot\u001b[81Guse hidden evaluation\u001b[105Gputs, external \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  \u001b[38;2;0;0;0mimplementations or other ports. Record profiling evidence, changes, tests and remaining limitations in NOTES.md.\u001b[39m      \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m\u23fa\u001b[3G\u001b[39mI'll start\u001b[14Gwith\u001b[19Gwhat\u001b[24Gprofiling\u001b[34Gtools\u001b[40Gexist\u001b[46Ghere\u001b[51Gand\u001b[55Gwhat\u001b[60Gthe\u001b[64Gdevelopment\u001b[76Gworkloads\u001b[86Gare\u001b[90G(the\u001b[95Gfixture\u001b[103Gprompts\u001b[111Gused\u001b[116Gby\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcheck.py).\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;102;102;102mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m\u23fa\u001b[3G\u001b[39mAppl\u001b[8G M1 a\u001b[14G ~60 GB/s matches the\u001b[36Gexpected\u001b[45Gsingle-core\u001b[57Gfigure,\u001b[65Gso\u001b[68GI'm\u001b[72Glooping\u001b[80Gthe\u001b[84Gfixture\u001b[92Gprompts\u001b[100Gand\u001b[104Gsampling\u001b[113Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bprocess\u001b[11Gwith\u001b["]
